# cloud/manifest — short commands for an ephemeral Linux VM (Qwiklabs / Google
# Skills Boost, Cloud Shell, a scratch GCE box).
#
# Close to the INVERSE of mini/manifest, which is the point of keeping the list
# in a file: the mini has no kubectl and builds no images, a GKE lab is nothing
# but kubectl and image builds.
#
# Not here, and why:
#   gv gx        need pbpaste; no clipboard on a headless Linux VM. Use gc "msg".
#   fd fdr       firebase CLI is not in a GCP lab image
#   hc hcg       `hub` is not installed and labs create no GitHub repos
#   rifa rifu    need `replace-in-files` (npm global)
#   sed-xmin     README marks it "Not Tested !!" and its sed script is BRE-invalid
#   dev4         no tmux config to go with it

